{"schema_version":2,"id":"p304-plant-air-messages","revision":1,"title_en":"Plants Can “Speak” to Each Other","title_zh":"植物之间的“对话”","level":"B1","primary_topic":"psychology_science","tags":["science","botany","chemicals","frontiers"],"source_type":"licensed_adaptation","fiction":false,"summary_zh":"当毛毛虫啃食叶片时，受创植物能向空气中释放茉莉酸甲酯等挥发性有机化合物。这些气体信号不仅能传导至同一植株未受损部位，还能扩散到临近植物，触发其提前激活防御机制。科学研究强调，这种“交流”本质上是环境中的化学信号响应，而非具有意识的语言对话。","featured":false,"admitted_at":"2026-11-21T14:22:19Z","paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"id":"s1","text":"A caterpillar takes a bite from a leaf.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"一条毛毛虫在一片叶子上咬了一口。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":1,"surface":"A","lemma":"a","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"一条"},{"start":2,"end":13,"surface":"caterpillar","lemma":"caterpillar","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"毛毛虫"},{"start":14,"end":19,"surface":"takes","lemma":"take","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"咬；咬下（与bite连用）"},{"start":20,"end":21,"surface":"a","lemma":"a","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"一"},{"start":22,"end":26,"surface":"bite","lemma":"bite","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"咬；咬的一口"},{"start":27,"end":31,"surface":"from","lemma":"from","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"从……上"},{"start":32,"end":33,"surface":"a","lemma":"a","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"一片"},{"start":34,"end":38,"surface":"leaf","lemma":"leaf","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"叶子"}],"phrases":[{"start":14,"end":26,"surface":"takes a bite","gloss_zh":"咬一口"}]},{"id":"s2","text":"The plant cannot run away, and the leaf will not grow back in time to stop the next bite.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"植物无法逃跑，而被咬伤的叶子也来不及重新长出以阻止接下来的啃食。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":3,"surface":"The","lemma":"the","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"这株"},{"start":4,"end":9,"surface":"plant","lemma":"plant","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"植物"},{"start":10,"end":16,"surface":"cannot","lemma":"cannot","pos":"情态动词＋否定副词","gloss_zh":"无法；不能"},{"start":17,"end":20,"surface":"run","lemma":"run","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"跑"},{"start":21,"end":25,"surface":"away","lemma":"away","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"离开（与run连用）"},{"start":27,"end":30,"surface":"and","lemma":"and","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"并且"},{"start":31,"end":34,"surface":"the","lemma":"the","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"那片"},{"start":35,"end":39,"surface":"leaf","lemma":"leaf","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"叶子"},{"start":40,"end":44,"surface":"will","lemma":"will","pos":"助动词","gloss_zh":"将"},{"start":45,"end":48,"surface":"not","lemma":"not","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"不"},{"start":49,"end":53,"surface":"grow","lemma":"grow","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"生长；长出"},{"start":54,"end":58,"surface":"back","lemma":"back","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"重新；恢复"},{"start":59,"end":61,"surface":"in","lemma":"in","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"及时（与time连用）"},{"start":62,"end":66,"surface":"time","lemma":"time","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"时间"},{"start":67,"end":69,"surface":"to","lemma":"to","pos":"不定式符号","gloss_zh":"引出目的动作"},{"start":70,"end":74,"surface":"stop","lemma":"stop","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"阻止"},{"start":75,"end":78,"surface":"the","lemma":"the","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"接下来的"},{"start":79,"end":83,"surface":"next","lemma":"next","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"下一次的"},{"start":84,"end":88,"surface":"bite","lemma":"bite","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"啃咬"}],"phrases":[{"start":17,"end":25,"surface":"run away","gloss_zh":"逃跑"},{"start":49,"end":58,"surface":"grow back","gloss_zh":"重新长出"},{"start":59,"end":66,"surface":"in time","gloss_zh":"及时"}]},{"id":"s3","text":"But the damage can set off a change that reaches farther than the spot where the caterpillar is feeding.","separator_after":"","translation_zh":"但这种创伤能够触发一系列变化，波及远超过毛毛虫正在进食的那个微小位置。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":3,"surface":"But","lemma":"but","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"但是"},{"start":4,"end":7,"surface":"the","lemma":"the","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"这种"},{"start":8,"end":14,"surface":"damage","lemma":"damage","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"创伤；损伤"},{"start":15,"end":18,"surface":"can","lemma":"can","pos":"情态动词","gloss_zh":"能够；可以"},{"start":19,"end":22,"surface":"set","lemma":"set","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"触发（与off连用）"},{"start":23,"end":26,"surface":"off","lemma":"off","pos"